[[63,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><span class=\"dead-link\">See in Op. 1016A10</span></p><p>- Disconnect the negative battery terminal.</p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connections for the injectors.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/771.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Injector</p></td><td><p>N070A</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/771.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Injector</p></td><td><p>N070B</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/771.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Climate control sytem control unit</p></td><td><p>M070C</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/771.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Injector</p></td><td><p>N070D</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/771.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Injector</p></td><td><p>N070E</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the pipe connectors from the injectors.</p><p>3. Undo the pipe connectors from the single fuel manifold.</p><p>4. Remove the pipes connecting the fuel manifold and the injectors.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/730.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>- Fit the new pipes from the manifold to the injectors.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Each time work is carried out on the pipes between the injectors and the fuel manifold, they have to be replaced with new ones to prevent fuel leaks from the connectors.</p></aside><p>- Tighten the pipe connectors on the return manifold and on the injectors to torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/774.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Value - daNm</p></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>.</p></td><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Connectors</p></td><td><p>PIPE FUEL MANIFOLD TO INJECTORS</p></td><td><p>M12X1.5</p></td></tr></table></div><p>- Connect the electrical connections for the injectors.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/771.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>.</p></td><td><p>Injector</p></td><td><p>N070A</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/771.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>.</p></td><td><p>Injector</p></td><td><p>N070B</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/771.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>.</p></td><td><p>Injector</p></td><td><p>N070C</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/771.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>.</p></td><td><p>Injector</p></td><td><p>N070D</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/771.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>.</p></td><td><p>Injector</p></td><td><p>N070E</p></td></tr></table></div><p><span class=\"dead-link\">See in Op. 1016A10</span></p><p>- Connect the negative battery terminal.</p>"]]